$ Disordered bcc atomic mobilities of Al and Ni, the base of the B2 model of
$ Helander and Agren, Acta Mater. 47 (1999) 1141, Appendix A (p. 1151),
$ https://doi.org/10.1016/S1359-6454(99)00010-5. MQ = -Q + R*T*LN(M0) with
$ Theta = LN(M0). The ordering terms of the same appendix are in
$ janus_kinetics.datasets.HELANDER1999_ALNI_ORDERING.
ELEMENT VA VACUUM 0 0 0 !
ELEMENT AL BLANK 0 0 0 !
ELEMENT NI BLANK 0 0 0 !
TYPE_DEFINITION % SEQ * !
PHASE BCC_A2 % 2 1 3 !
CONSTITUENT BCC_A2 :AL,NI:VA: !
PARAMETER MQ(BCC_A2&AL,AL:VA;0) 298.15 -215000+R*T*LN(6.5E-5); 6000 N !
PARAMETER MQ(BCC_A2&AL,NI:VA;0) 298.15 -215000+R*T*LN(6.5E-5); 6000 N !
PARAMETER MQ(BCC_A2&AL,AL,NI:VA;0) 298.15 +327400; 6000 N !
PARAMETER MQ(BCC_A2&NI,AL:VA;0) 298.15 -204000+R*T*LN(1.8E-5); 6000 N !
PARAMETER MQ(BCC_A2&NI,NI:VA;0) 298.15 -204000+R*T*LN(1.8E-5); 6000 N !
PARAMETER MQ(BCC_A2&NI,AL,NI:VA;0) 298.15 +327400; 6000 N !
